r hits roll the %d%% chance, once per target per turn) match EFF_KROG_WRATH.callbackOnDealDamage behavior per context; the base %d%% chance is preserved.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0079\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target conveys linking with the horror and %d%% 全部抗性, matching resists={all=eff.resist} and the established resists.all/全部抗性 terminology per context; no material defect is establishable for the gain's subject given the supplied evidence.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0080\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target conveys empowerment on seeing black blood granting %d%% 全部抗性, matching SPIKESKIN resists={all=eff.power} and terminology per context.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0081\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target conveys %d stacks granting +%d%% to all damage dealt; the compressed phrasing remains unambiguous given the '+' sign and the context-described inc_damage={all=...} benefit.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0082\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target renders the pustule count and %d%% 全部抗性 gain, with 全部抗性 supported by the context-described temporary resists {all=stacks*power}.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0083\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target conveys a %d%% reduction of all damage taken, matching WARBORN resists={all=eff.power} per context; spacing is cosmetic only.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0084\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target conveys %d%% reduction of all damage taken and removal of all detrimental effects on application, matching GASTRIC_WAVE_BUFF per context; the missing final punctuation is not material.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0085\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target conveys %d%% reduction of all damage done and a 6-turn extension of all detrimental-effect durations on application, matching GASTRIC_WAVE_DEBUFF inc_damage={all=-eff.power} and duration extension per context.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0086\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target renders the log as the revelation shortening the named talent's cooldown, matching alterTalentCoolingdown(tid, -eff.cd) per context rather than the vaguer 'is energized'; placeholders preserved.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0087\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target uses 虚空之星 for the restored stacks, matching the context-established Void Stars term despite the English 'void shards'; count %d and the reaving action are preserved.\",\n      \"defect_atoms\": [],\n      \"source_evidence_sha256s\": [],\n      \"limitations\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"RFR-0088\",\n      \"label\": \"CLEAN\",\n      \"evidence_statement\": \"Target renders the guardian's movement-speed increase, matching m.movement_speed = m